Correctness
-----------
selftest passed: 522242 memberships

The self-test enumerates every binary string of length 0..8 over {NUL, 'a'} and checks
both k=1 and k=2 index results against independent full dynamic programming. The larger
benchmarks below also agree exactly with an independent trie-DP implementation and Tantivy.

